@startuml AddItemToCartCommunication
title Communication Diagram - Add Product Listing to Cart

top to bottom direction

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype polyline
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam nodesep 70
skinparam ranksep 65
skinparam rectangle {
  RoundCorner 6
  Padding 10
  BackgroundColor<<Boundary>> #E8F1FF
  BorderColor<<Boundary>> #3B73B9
  BackgroundColor<<Control>> #FFF4D6
  BorderColor<<Control>> #B98900
  BackgroundColor<<Entity>> #E8F7E8
  BorderColor<<Entity>> #3B8F3B
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFF8DC
  BorderColor #A8A29E
}

rectangle "customer:Customer" as Customer <<Actor>>
rectangle "cartPage:CartPage" as CartPage <<Boundary>>
rectangle "cartController:CartController" as CartController <<Boundary>>
rectangle "cartService:CartService" as CartService <<Control>>

rectangle "listingRepo:\nProductListingRepository" as ListingRepo
rectangle "cartRepo:\nCartRepository" as CartRepo
rectangle "unitOfWork:UnitOfWork" as UnitOfWork

rectangle "listing:ProductListing" as Listing <<Entity>>
rectangle "cart:ShoppingCart" as Cart <<Entity>>
rectangle "item:CartItem" as CartItem <<Entity>>

' Top row
Customer -[hidden]right-> CartPage
CartPage -[hidden]right-> CartController

' Force CartService below the caller chain
CartPage -[hidden]down-> CartService

' Repository/entity rows
ListingRepo -[hidden]right-> CartRepo
CartRepo -[hidden]right-> UnitOfWork
Listing -[hidden]right-> Cart
Cart -[hidden]right-> CartItem

Customer -right-> CartPage : 1: add item
CartPage -right-> CartController : 1.1: POST /api/cart
CartController -down-> CartService : 1.2: AddItemAsync(request)

CartService -down-> ListingRepo : 1.3: get listing
ListingRepo -down-> Listing : 1.3.1: load

CartService -down-> CartRepo : 1.5: get active cart
CartRepo -down-> Cart : 1.5.1: return

CartService -down-> UnitOfWork : 1.9: save changes

CartService -down-> Listing : 1.4: check status\nand inventory
CartService -down-> Cart : 1.6: create cart\n1.7: find item
CartService -down-> CartItem : 1.8a: create item\n1.8b: update quantity

note right of CartService
Coordinates the use case:
validates the listing,
retrieves or creates the cart,
updates items and commits.
end note

@enduml